WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:10.310
To see how a campaign performed, go to the Broadcasts page, find the campaign, and click View Analytics. Eazybe opens the full report for that broadcast.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:25.300
At the top, you'll find the broadcast name and status, the WhatsApp number it was sent from, the date it went out, the total contacts, and the total credit used — plus the broadcast source and a preview of the exact message sent.

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:35.040
In Delivery activity, switch between Total, Sent, Delivered, Read, and Failed. Each row shows the contact, the message time, and its latest status.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:48.380
Open the Failed tab to see which messages didn't get through. Each row shows the failure reason exactly as Meta reports it — for example, this message was not delivered to maintain healthy ecosystem engagement.

00:00:48.880 --> 00:01:00.520
Use Search contacts to look up a single phone number, or click Export to download whichever delivery group is currently open — Total, or just the failed contacts to fix and retry.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:12.200
Choose 10, 25, or 50 rows per page to move through recipients, then click Back to broadcasts when you're done — and that's your campaign performance, end to end.
